{"translation-revision-date":"2026-08-19 06:46:39+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.1.0","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n > 1;","lang":"tr"},"Add New":["Yeni Ekle"],"Some errors occurred while deleting the post types: %s":["Yaz\u0131 t\u00fcrleri silinirken baz\u0131 hatalar olu\u015ftu: %s"],"Failed to create taxonomy.":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma olu\u015fturulamad\u0131."],"Where this taxonomy appears: REST API, admin UI, and front-end surfaces.":["Bu s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rman\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnd\u00fc\u011f\u00fc yerler: REST API, y\u00f6netici aray\u00fcz\u00fc ve \u00f6n y\u00fcz y\u00fczeyleri."],"Core identity, post types, and activation.":["Temel kimlik, yaz\u0131 t\u00fcrleri ve etkinle\u015ftirme."],"Edit this taxonomy. Expand the Labels section to adjust labels.":["Bu s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmay\u0131 d\u00fczenleyin. Etiketleri ayarlamak i\u00e7in Etiketler b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc geni\u015fletin."],"Define a new taxonomy. Fill in the essentials under General; expand Labels to customize.":["Yeni bir s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma tan\u0131mlay\u0131n. Genel alt\u0131ndaki temel bilgileri doldurun; \u00f6zelle\u015ftirmek i\u00e7in Etiketler'i geni\u015fletin."],"Add taxonomy":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma ekle"],"Quick edit taxonomy":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmay\u0131 h\u0131zl\u0131 d\u00fczenle"],"Failed to update taxonomy.":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma g\u00fcncellenemedi."],"\"%s\" taxonomy updated.":["\"%s\" s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmas\u0131 g\u00fcncellendi."],"Whether terms can be displayed in the Tag Cloud widget.":["Terimlerin Etiket Bulutu bile\u015feninde g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fclenip g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fclenemeyece\u011fi."],"Available in Tag Cloud widget":["Etiket Bulutu bile\u015feninde kullan\u0131labilir"],"Whether terms are selectable in the theme nav menu builder.":["Terimlerin tema gezinme men\u00fcs\u00fc olu\u015fturucusunda se\u00e7ilebilir olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131."],"Available in nav menus":["Gezinme men\u00fclerinde kullan\u0131labilir"],"Whether to display a column for the taxonomy on the associated post type list tables.":["\u0130li\u015fkili yaz\u0131 t\u00fcr\u00fc liste tablolar\u0131nda s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma i\u00e7in bir s\u00fctun g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fclenip g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fclenmeyece\u011fi."],"Show admin column":["Y\u00f6netici s\u00fctununu g\u00f6ster"],"Whether to show the taxonomy in the Quick\/Bulk Edit panel.":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rman\u0131n H\u0131zl\u0131\/Toplu D\u00fczenleme panelinde g\u00f6sterilip g\u00f6sterilmeyece\u011fi."],"Show in Quick Edit":["H\u0131zl\u0131 D\u00fczenleme'de g\u00f6ster"],"Whether to show the taxonomy in the admin menu. Has no effect when Show admin UI is off; the value is preserved either way.":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rman\u0131n y\u00f6netici men\u00fcs\u00fcnde g\u00f6sterilip g\u00f6sterilmeyece\u011fi. Y\u00f6netici aray\u00fcz\u00fcn\u00fc g\u00f6ster kapal\u0131yken etkisizdir; de\u011fer her durumda korunur."],"Show in admin menu":["Y\u00f6netici men\u00fcs\u00fcnde g\u00f6ster"],"Whether to generate a default admin interface for managing terms.":["Terimleri y\u00f6netmek i\u00e7in varsay\u0131lan bir y\u00f6netici aray\u00fcz\u00fc olu\u015fturulup olu\u015fturulmayaca\u011f\u0131."],"Show admin UI":["Y\u00f6netici aray\u00fcz\u00fcn\u00fc g\u00f6ster"],"Whether front-end queries (e.g. ?taxonomy=\u2026&term=\u2026) can return terms from this taxonomy.":["\u00d6n y\u00fcz sorgular\u0131n\u0131n (\u00f6rne\u011fin ?taxonomy=\u2026&term=\u2026) bu s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmadan terim d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcp d\u00f6nd\u00fcremeyece\u011fi."],"Publicly queryable":["Herkese a\u00e7\u0131k sorgulanabilir"],"Required for the block editor. Turn off only for taxonomies that should not be exposed via REST.":["Blok d\u00fczenleyici i\u00e7in gereklidir. Yaln\u0131zca REST \u00fczerinden a\u00e7\u0131\u011fa \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131lmamas\u0131 gereken s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmalar i\u00e7in kapat\u0131n."],"Override the text WordPress shows in admin lists, menus, and forms. Auto-fill replaces every label below with values derived from the current plural and singular names \u2014 including any you have already customized. Clearing removes all overrides so WordPress falls back to its defaults. If you rename the taxonomy after auto-filling, click Auto-fill again to keep them in sync.":["WordPress'in y\u00f6netici listelerinde, men\u00fclerinde ve formlar\u0131nda g\u00f6sterdi\u011fi metni ge\u00e7ersiz k\u0131l\u0131n. Otomatik doldurma, a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki her etiketi mevcut \u00e7o\u011ful ve tekil adlardan t\u00fcretilen de\u011ferlerle de\u011fi\u015ftirir \u2014 zaten \u00f6zelle\u015ftirdikleriniz de dahil. Temizlemek t\u00fcm ge\u00e7ersiz k\u0131lmalar\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131r, b\u00f6ylece WordPress varsay\u0131lanlar\u0131na geri d\u00f6ner. Otomatik doldurmadan sonra s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmay\u0131 yeniden adland\u0131r\u0131rsan\u0131z, e\u015fitlemeyi korumak i\u00e7in tekrar Otomatik doldur'a t\u0131klay\u0131n."],"Choose from the most used":["En \u00e7ok kullan\u0131lanlardan se\u00e7in"],"Shown in the meta box when JavaScript is disabled. Not used on hierarchical taxonomies.":["JavaScript devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 oldu\u011funda meta kutusunda g\u00f6sterilir. Hiyerar\u015fik s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmalarda kullan\u0131lmaz."],"Add or remove items":["\u00d6\u011fe ekle veya kald\u0131r"],"Same as Parent item, with a colon at the end.":["\u00dcst \u00f6\u011fe ile ayn\u0131, sonunda iki nokta \u00fcst \u00fcste ile."],"Shown in the taxonomy meta box. Not used on hierarchical taxonomies.":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma meta kutusunda g\u00f6sterilir. Hiyerar\u015fik s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmalarda kullan\u0131lmaz."],"Separate items with commas":["\u00d6\u011feleri virg\u00fclle ay\u0131r\u0131n"],"The popular items text. Not used on hierarchical taxonomies.":["Pop\u00fcler \u00f6\u011feler metni. Hiyerar\u015fik s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmalarda kullan\u0131lmaz."],"Popular items":["Be\u011fenilen \u00f6\u011feler"],"Not used on non-hierarchical taxonomies.":["Hiyerar\u015fik olmayan s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmalarda kullan\u0131lmaz."],"Parent item":["\u00dcst \u00f6\u011fe"],"Label displayed after a term has been updated.":["Bir terim g\u00fcncellendikten sonra g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fclenen etiket."],"\u2190 Back to Categories":["\u2190  Kategorilere geri d\u00f6n"],"Back to items":["\u00d6\u011felere geri d\u00f6n"],"The text displayed when no terms are available in the term meta box and tag cloud.":["Terim meta kutusunda ve etiket bulutunda hi\u00e7bir terim yokken g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fclenen metin."],"New item name":["Yeni \u00f6\u011fe ad\u0131"],"Update item":["\u00d6\u011feyi g\u00fcncelle"],"A default term name is required.":["Bir varsay\u0131lan terim ad\u0131 gerekli."],"Once saved, updating the name creates a new term \u2014 the previous default term remains in the terms list. To change the term's slug or description, edit it from the terms list.":["Kaydedildikten sonra ad\u0131 g\u00fcncellemek yeni bir terim olu\u015fturur \u2014 \u00f6nceki varsay\u0131lan terim, terimler listesinde kal\u0131r. Terimin k\u0131sa ad\u0131n\u0131 veya a\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftirmek i\u00e7in onu terimler listesinden d\u00fczenleyin."],"Default term name":["Varsay\u0131lan terim ad\u0131"],"Default term to be used for the taxonomy, similar to how \"Uncategorized\" works for categories.":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma i\u00e7in kullan\u0131lacak varsay\u0131lan terim; kategoriler i\u00e7in \"Kategorisiz\"in \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma bi\u00e7imine benzer."],"Set a default term":["Bir varsay\u0131lan terim ayarla"],"Whether terms in this taxonomy should be saved in the order they are assigned to an item.":["Bu s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmadaki terimlerin, bir \u00f6\u011feye atand\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131rayla kaydedilip kaydedilmeyece\u011fi."],"Sort terms":["Terimleri s\u0131rala"],"View terms":["Terimleri g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle"],"Duplicate taxonomy":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmay\u0131 \u00e7o\u011falt"],"Failed to duplicate taxonomy.":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma \u00e7o\u011falt\u0131lamad\u0131."],"\"%s\" taxonomy created.":["\"%s\" s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmas\u0131 olu\u015fturuldu."],"taxonomy\u0004%s (Copy)":["%s (Kopya)"],"One or more post types with which the taxonomy should be associated.":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rman\u0131n ili\u015fkilendirilmesi gereken bir veya daha fazla yaz\u0131 t\u00fcr\u00fc."],"Post types":["Yaz\u0131 t\u00fcrleri"],"This taxonomy key is already in use.":["Bu s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma anahtar\u0131 zaten kullan\u0131mda."],"Lower case letters, numbers, underscores, and dashes only. Maximum length: 32 characters.":["Yaln\u0131zca k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck harfler, say\u0131lar, alt \u00e7izgiler ve tireler. En fazla uzunluk: 32 karakter."],"Changing the key renames the taxonomy \u2014 existing terms may become inaccessible until a migration updates the database.":["Anahtar\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftirmek s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmay\u0131 yeniden adland\u0131r\u0131r \u2014 bir ta\u015f\u0131ma i\u015flemi veritaban\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcncelleyene kadar mevcut terimlere eri\u015filemeyebilir."],"Taxonomy key":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma anahtar\u0131"],"When on, terms behave like categories with parent-child relationships. When off, terms behave like tags.":["A\u00e7\u0131kken, terimler \u00fcst-alt ili\u015fkileriyle kategoriler gibi davran\u0131r. Kapal\u0131yken, terimler etiketler gibi davran\u0131r."],"Optional summary of the taxonomy. Shown in admin UIs that surface taxonomy details.":["S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rman\u0131n iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 \u00f6zeti. S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6steren y\u00f6netici aray\u00fczlerinde g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fclenir."],"Choose from the most 